              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Placement targeting specifies where your ads appear on Pinterest; selecting Browse restricts delivery to browsing surfaces rather than search results.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Placement targeting intro",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "As a signal, targeting must comply with Pinterest Advertising Guidelines: non-compliant targeting triggers an Ads Manager notification and the ad is not distributed until re-approved, with review taking up to 24 hours.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Ad review process",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "use_cases",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "inferred",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Use it when you want to reach people while they passively explore their home feeds and related Pins, rather than while they search with a specific query in mind.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Browse placement description",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Do not rely on it when your goal depends on capturing search-driven intent; the Search placement or All (recommended) covers both contexts.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Note on default placement",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Restricting to Browse narrows reach compared with the default All setting, which is recommended to maximise chances of reaching people across all areas of Pinterest.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Note on default placement",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "setup",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "In Ads Manager, log in to your Pinterest business account and click the hamburger icon at the top left.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Add placement targeting in Ads Manager",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Under Manage campaigns, click Create campaign, then click Manual campaign and Get started.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Add placement targeting in Ads Manager",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Click New ad group from the left-hand side navigation, then click Targeting.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Add placement targeting in Ads Manager",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Scroll down to Advanced options, and under Ad group placement select All (recommended), Browse, or Search.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Advanced options",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Continue with Budget and schedule, Optimisation and delivery, and Ads, review your information, then click Publish.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Add placement targeting in Ads Manager",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "In Bulk Editor, download a sample sheet, fill in column Z (Ad placement) with SEARCH, BROWSE, or leave it blank to target all placements, then upload the template.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Add placement targeting in Bulk Editor",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "After launch, campaigns are reviewed against Pinterest Advertising Guidelines and distribution begins only once approved; review can take up to 24 hours.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.placements",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/placement",
                "locator": "Ad review process",
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Ad placements",
                "raw_sha256": null,
